x86_64-windows  `dynamic_cast` is refused for this target by name. The Itanium ABI hangs a type_info off the vtable's second slot and walks the graph those objects carry; the Microsoft ABI puts a complete-object locator in *front* of the vtable and answers through __RTDynamicCast, which is a different set of structures and a different runtime call - measured for Itanium only so far. The refusal is at src/parser/ParserExprNew.cpp and is in docs/EXCLUSIONS.md; when the Microsoft half lands, this file goes.
